Open a keys page with a Keys action

Nothing in the viewer said its keys. A configuration may now name a
markdown page, keys-page, which the Keys action opens as the next page
in the history, so HistoryPrevious comes back to the document. With no
page named the action does nothing, and on the page itself it does
nothing again.

